{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n<p>Drink Now 是一款針對 iOS 與 macOS 而設的飲水提醒與補水追蹤工具，特別適合長時間坐在辦公室、經常忘記喝水的上班族與學生。它會按照你的作息發出補水提示，並記錄每日飲水量，協助你建立穩定的飲水習慣。程式原價 US $0.99，現正限時免費，可於 App Store 下載。</p>\n\n<h2>智能補水提醒與飲水追蹤</h2>\n<p>Drink Now 可依你的生活節奏設定個人化飲水目標，並以適時提醒鼓勵你規律補水，提醒頻率、時間表與通知方式均可自行調整。記錄飲水份量同樣簡單，快速輸入每次攝取量即可查看每日進度與習慣變化，逐步建立長遠健康作息。介面簡潔無干擾，支援 iOS 與 macOS，運作輕巧流暢，資料以本機方式記錄，注重私隱。</p>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1242x2688bb-253-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1242x2688bb-254-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1242x2688bb-255-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1242x2688bb-256-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<ul>\n<li>應用名稱：Daily Water Reminder: DrinkNow</li>\n<li>應用類別：Health &amp; Fitness</li>\n<li>下載位置：App Store</li>\n</ul>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-14T01:39:02.950733+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":382,"images":4,"source":"New MobileLife","fallback":"none"},"published_at":"2026-10-13T23:47:50+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-14T01:32:08.434207+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-14T01:32:08.434207+00:00","content_hash":"5aa44d99150309d9a72e1ff3eb049e5a3822291b9527d1a8e392ed319e80c50e","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null}